  "notes": [
    "The attacker hit the Edgeless wallet (older library 0x4f2875f6) before the Swarm City and aeternity wallets (library 0xa657491c); both library versions carry the same unguarded initWallet, so one incident anchored on the first initWallet. No external initWallet by a non-owner precedes it.",
    "The White Hat Group and allied rescuers (0x1dba1131, 0x1ff21eca, 0xd1f27c48 and others) re-initialized hundreds of wallets and returned the ETH, so they are affiliated (rule 5). Campaign: the attacker's other inits and drains plus five dust copycats that kept under 1.5 ETH.",
